  "visualReview": {
    "corrected": "The nine-step far-left approach no longer protrudes behind the lantern. Native hero/overhead show a compact real flight with joined guards and a continuous earth-bedded route; the old low mask no longer cuts through the island. Native low shows irregular masonry and real lower bank cover, while R08 large pale high boulders are gone. All67 held tree growth/rigid pose records verify.",
