    "nextFailures": [
      "Hall-side shoulder is still a smooth greenish band and the visible upper ashlar remains plainly CG. Actual foundation/bank exposure needs closer HD9 modeling, not more hiding plants.",
      "Tower-side mineral/green slope remains bare and geometric. Good tree poses are now available to hold while the wrong terrain is repaired.",
      "Hero lantern profile, bridge/guard joints and scale, ceramic/timber rhythms, generic shrine figure, forest species/palette and lighting remain unaccepted."
    ],
